usually notify you about these instances in advance, or where that is not possible, as soon as reasonably practicable after the information has been collected."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Personal information may also be collected via cameras installed in venues or chapels for the purpose of providing requested services to our clients."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Whilst the choice of how much personal information is disclosed to us is left completely up to the client and, from time to time, clients may be able to deal with us anonymously or by pseudonym, if clients do not provide us with certain personal information we may not be able to provide clients with the services and products that they seek."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Why do we gather the information and how will we use it?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The personal information that we collect and hold about you depends on your interaction with us. Generally, we collect, use and hold your personal information for the purposes of:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"providing products or services to you or someone else you know;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"providing you with newsletters, information and other communications;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"providing you with information about other products or services that we offer that may be of interest to you;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"involving you in promotions and other initiatives undertaken by us;"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"facilitating our internal business operations, including the fulfilment of any legal requirements; and"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"analysing our services and customer needs with a view to improving those services."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"By submitting personal information to us, clients agree that Living Legacy Tree may obtain, hold and use the personal information for the purposes of providing clients with its products or services, and for its internal business purposes."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We gather personal information to enable us to provide our clients with the personalised services that they request. We may also use or disclose personal information for related purposes, such as servicing and managing our relationship with clients, our internal accounting or business management processes and in order to comply with our regulatory reporting and legal obligations."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"In the future, we may use the information to provide clients with personalised information about our products and services. If at any time a client does not wish to receive any communications about our products or services, they can opt out by indicating so in the initial application process or by contacting our Privacy Officer."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"As with other business organisations, we also rely on third party service providers, agents, suppliers and contractors to provide some of our services, such as memorialisation services, transfer services and bereavement registers. Any personal information provided to these agents and contractors is provided only to perform their agreed tasks. To protect our clients'' personal information we require these organisations to be bound by strict confidentiality and non-disclosure agreements with us in respect of any personal information we disclose to them."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Security"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Consistent with our commitment to protecting personal information, we make all reasonable endeavours to protect such information securely against unauthorised access, use, modification or disclosure. Client information will be recorded, amended and used only by authorised personnel who are instructed to keep your information confidential."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We take care to ensure that the personal information you give us is protected. For example, all systems we use to digitally store and process your personal information to service your needs have electronic security systems in place, including the use of firewalls, user identifiers, passwords or other access codes to control access to your personal information."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"These digital security measures are augmented with document storage security policies, security measures for systems access, providing a discreet environment for confidential discussions, only allowing access to personal information where the individual seeking access has satisfied our identification requirements, and access control for our buildings and sensitive infrastructure."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Links to other websites"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Our website may contain links to other websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of linked websites. It is your responsibility to investigate the privacy policies of those other sites."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cookies"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"To improve your experience on our websites, we may use cookies."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A cookie is a small text file that our websites may place on your computer or device as a tool to remember your preferences. You may refuse the use of cookies by selecting the appropriate settings on your browser, however, please note that if you do this, you may not be able to use the full functionality of our websites."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Our websites use Google Analytics, a service which transmits website traffic data to Google servers in the United States. Google Analytics does not identify individual users or associate your IP address with any other data held by Google. We use reports provided by Google Analytics to help us understand website traffic and website usage."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"In particular, we use the following Google Analytics services in relation to display advertising: re-marketing, Google Analytics demographics and interest reporting. These services use first party and third party cookies so that, when you visit third party websites, advertisements may be displayed for services and products which you viewed on our website(s)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You can opt out of Google Analytics if you disable or refuse cookies or use the opt out service provided by Google Analytics at "},{"type":"text","text":"https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout/","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout/"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Access and correcting personal information"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Living Legacy aims to take such steps as are reasonable, in the circumstances, to ensure that the personal information we collect, hold, use and disclose about our clients is accurate, complete and up to date. However, the accuracy of the personal information is largely reliant on the quality of personal information that our clients provide to us."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Clients may request details (in writing) of the personal information that our company holds about them or they may correct or update information we hold about them by contacting our Privacy Officer. We will endeavour to respond to a client''s request for access or correction within a reasonable period after the request is made and we may charge a reasonable fee for responding to the request. We may also collect personal information about you from third parties acting on your behalf (for instance, agents)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"There are some exceptions specified by law where we may refuse a client''s request for access or correction. However, if one of these circumstances applies, we will provide the client with a written explanation of the reasons for refusal, unless it would be unreasonable to provide that notice."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Complaints"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Complaints about the way we collect, use or disclose client personal information are to be directed to our Privacy Officer. Our Privacy Officer will confirm receipt of a complaint within 10 business days after the complaint is received and will then investigate the complaint and provide a response within a reasonable time."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If, after receiving our response, there are still concerns that the privacy complaint remains unresolved, clients may then, for example, take the complaint to the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Changes to this privacy policy"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We may make changes to this Privacy Policy from time to time for any reason. We will publish those changes on our website at "},{"type":"text","text":"www.livinglegacy.com.au","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://livinglegacy.com.au"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Contact"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Street address: Level 4, 349 Collins Street, Melbourne VIC 3000"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Email address: "},{"type":"text","text":"contact@livinglegacy.com.au","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"mailto:contact@livinglegacy.com.au"}}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Telephone: "},{"type":"text","text":"03 7019 6142","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"tel:0370196142"}}]}]}]}]}]},"seoDescription":"How Living Legacy collects, holds, uses and discloses personal information, in line with the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the Australian Privacy Principles."}', 1794281081563);
INSERT INTO legal_pages (id, slug, title, body, seo_description, status, published_at, last_published_at, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('legal_terms', 'terms-and-conditions', 'Terms and conditions', '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Living Legacy Standard Terms and Conditions 2016 Ver 1.0"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Waiver & Release"}]},{"type":"orderedList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I desire to participate voluntarily in the planting and memorial activities facilitated by Living Legacy Forest Pty Ltd (“LLT”) on the SITE."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I understand, accept, and assume the risks associated with participation in any and all activities relating to the planting day and accessing the conservation site. I also assume the responsibility of conducting myself in a civil manner that is mutually beneficial to all participants. Unacceptable conduct generally includes, but is not limited to theft, profanity, causing damage whether intentionally or recklessly and any offensive behaviour. I agree and understand that I should wear suitable clothes and shoes for"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I assume full responsibility for any injuries which may occur to me, as well as the safety of my family and guests, and do hereby fully and forever discharge and release LLT, South West Catchments Council, and the SITE owner and their employees, board members, officers, agents, authorized volunteers, representatives, consultants, insurers and sureties, and their successors and assigns (collectively, the \"Released Parties\") from any \"Claims.” \"Claims,\" as used in this document, mean any and all claims, demands, damages, rights of action or causes of action, present or future, whether the same be known, anticipated or unanticipated, resulting from or arising out of my presence or the presence of my family members and guests at the garden, activities at the SITE, and/or participation in activities connected with the SITE or LLT including, without limitation, any of the foregoing resulting from or arising out of the negligence of a Released Party. Further, I hereby waive any and all Claims against a Released Party."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I expressly acknowledge that participation in the SITE and memorial forest is for my purposes and not for the purpose of any one or more of the Released Parties."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I understand and agree that the conservation legacy zone service is provided fully by South West Catchments Council, and to the extent legally permissible, I release, indemnify and hold LLT and the land owner harmless from any and all claims related to the planting and maintenance of my trees in the conservation zone except to the extent such claim relates directly to any damage or loss resulting from the treatment of ashes by LLT."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have read, understand and agree to the terms and responsibilities as stated in this document including the standard terms and conditions on page 2 of this document."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"(Or Parent/legal guardian signature if participant is under the age of 18)."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Living Legacy Memorial Tree terms & warranty"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"CONGRATULATIONS on choosing to honour the circle of life through a Living Legacy memorial."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We are proud to offer LIVING LEGACY TREE to retell the life stories of your loved one. We understand how important this event is and we want to do everything we can to ensure the healthy growth of your LIVING LEGACY TREE. Before you proceed, please ensure you understand the different options we provide; each option will involve a different level of care and maintenance of your LIVING LEGACY TREE. When you elect to plant your LIVING LEGACY TREE at one of our partner conservation parks or sanctuaries you will need to sign the attached waiver. Where you choose to plant your LIVING LEGACY TREE privately Living Legacy Pty Ltd can only provide limited warranties that relate to the effectiveness of our ash treatment and its suitability for native plants in healthy soil. Under any of these options we suggest that you retain a small amount of ash in a keepsake. We offer a beautiful crystal keepsake as part of your package."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancellations & Refunds"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancellations made at within 21 from purchase will be fully refunded (less a 5% charge for administration and processing fees from third parties)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancellations made at after 21 days but at least 21 days prior to the planting day will be refunded 50% of the purchase price."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancellations made less than 21 days prior to the planting date, will not be refunded, except in situations of legitimate and substantiated emergency and where Living Legacy has agreed to provide a full refund (less the booking fee)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For this project, Living Legacy will commit significant funds to the conservation and management of the planting day and memorial sanctuary. These funds are allocated based on the purchases made prior to the planting date, so we are unable to give refunds within the 21 day period preceding the planting date."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Planted LIVING LEGACY TREES"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Our patented infusion process is the culmination of years of research and development but is simple to use. LIVING LEGACY REPRESENTATIVES can undertake the infusion process and you may be able to take part in the process"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Independent Laboratory tests resulted in 100% success rate for native trees in Australian soils recommended by a certified local nursery for your location."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Accordingly, Living Legacy Pty Ltd guarantees the growth of native trees in healthy soils subject to natural attrition and force majeure."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Even where all precautions are taken natural attrition rates apply for all trees for various reasons including but not limited to (extreme weather, flooding, disease or vandalism) known as “Force Majeure” and as such the Living Legacy Pty Ltd guarantee does not apply to damage or loss resulting from any force Majeure events."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Even though the likelihood of unsuccessful infusion is extremely low, due to the unavoidable natural attrition rate of any tree Living Legacy Pty Ltd recommends that ALL customers retain a small part of the cremated remains which can be used as a contingency if the original tree(s) fail to grow successfully in the first instance. If a LIVING LEGACY TREE which is planted in accordance with the LIVING LEGACY CARE AND MAINTENANCE GUIDELINES fails to grow or dies within the first 5 years due to Living Legacy’s default but not where due to any Force Majeure event Living Legacy will replace the tree and re-perform infusion at no cost to you."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"LL agrees to carry out its services in accordance with the standards of the profession or practice relevant to the performance of those obligations, and exercising that degree of skill, care, diligence, prudence, foresight and operating practice which would reasonably and ordinarily be expected from a skilled and experienced person engaged in a similar type of undertaking as that of LL under the same or similar circumstances."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The following are confirmations that you, understand the warranties provided by Living Legacy, by purchasing this LIVING LEGACY TREE you confirm that you have read these instructions and agree to the following:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"LL does not warrant successful infusion where LL Guidelines are not followed, or where failure to grow is the result of environmental factors, force majeure or due to any mishandling or error made by Client."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You acknowledge that by purchasing LIVING LEGACY TREE that you do not do so in reliance on any representation, warranty or other provision except as expressly provided herein, and any conditions, warranties or other terms implied by statute or common law are, to the greatest extent permissible by law, excluded from this agreement to the fullest extent permitted by law."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You understand that except for the warranties provided in this clause, you accept full responsibility for your LIVING LEGACY TREE upon taking receipt of the TREE(S)."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You understand that you are responsible for choosing the appropriate tree, soil and location for the Living Legacy Tree. You are also responsible for providing security, care and maintenance of the tree and the site where the tree is located and with exception of the warranties provided herein you indemnify and hold Living Legacy harmless from and against any and all claims resulting from incidents occurring after delivery of the LIVING LEGACY TREE, or in relation to the maintenance and care of the tree."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Living Legacy’s sole and exclusive remedy for failed infusion or other breach of contract is to replace the tree(s) originally selected for infusion and re-supply the LIVING LEGACY TREE. You acknowledge that Living Legacy is not responsible for and will in no circumstances be responsible for retaining part of the ashes as a contingency if a new tree is to be planted under warranty."}]}]}', 'Terms and conditions and the customer waiver for the Wellington Dam Memorial Forest conservation zone.', 'published', 1794281081563, 1794281081563, 1794281081563, 1794281081563);
INSERT INTO revisions (id, entity_type, entity_id, snapshot, created_at) VALUES ('legal_terms_r1', 'legal_page', 'legal_terms', '{"title":"Terms and conditions","body":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Living Legacy Standard Terms and Conditions 2016 Ver 1.0"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Waiver & Release"}]},{"type":"orderedList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I desire to participate voluntarily in the planting and memorial activities facilitated by Living Legacy Forest Pty Ltd (“LLT”) on the SITE."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I understand, accept, and assume the risks associated with participation in any and all activities relating to the planting day and accessing the conservation site. I also assume the responsibility of conducting myself in a civil manner that is mutually beneficial to all participants. Unacceptable conduct generally includes, but is not limited to theft, profanity, causing damage whether intentionally or recklessly and any offensive behaviour. I agree and understand that I should wear suitable clothes and shoes for"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I assume full responsibility for any injuries which may occur to me, as well as the safety of my family and guests, and do hereby fully and forever discharge and release LLT, South West Catchments Council, and the SITE owner and their employees, board members, officers, agents, authorized volunteers, representatives, consultants, insurers and sureties, and their successors and assigns (collectively, the \"Released Parties\") from any \"Claims.” \"Claims,\" as used in this document, mean any and all claims, demands, damages, rights of action or causes of action, present or future, whether the same be known, anticipated or unanticipate