text","text":"Planted LIVING LEGACY TREES"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Our patented infusion process is the culmination of years of research and development but is simple to use. LIVING LEGACY REPRESENTATIVES can undertake the infusion process and you may be able to take part in the process"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Independent Laboratory tests resulted in 100% success rate for native trees in Australian soils recommended by a certified local nursery for your location."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Accordingly, Living Legacy Pty Ltd guarantees the growth of native trees in healthy soils subject to natural attrition and force majeure."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Even where all precautions are taken natural attrition rates apply for all trees for various reasons including but not limited to (extreme weather, flooding, disease or vandalism) known as “Force Majeure” and as such the Living Legacy Pty Ltd guarantee does not apply to damage or loss resulting from any force Majeure events."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Even though the likelihood of unsuccessful infusion is extremely low, due to the unavoidable natural attrition rate of any tree Living Legacy Pty Ltd recommends that ALL customers retain a small part of the cremated remains which can be used as a contingency if the original tree(s) fail to grow successfully in the first instance. If a LIVING LEGACY TREE which is planted in accordance with the LIVING LEGACY CARE AND MAINTENANCE GUIDELINES fails to grow or dies within the first 5 years due to Living Legacy’s default but not where due to any Force Majeure event Living Legacy will replace the tree and re-perform infusion at no cost to you."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"LL agrees to carry out its services in accordance with the standards of the profession or practice relevant to the performance of those obligations, and exercising that degree of skill, care, diligence, prudence, foresight and operating practice which would reasonably and ordinarily be expected from a skilled and experienced person engaged in a similar type of undertaking as that of LL under the same or similar circumstances."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The following are confirmations that you, understand the warranties provided by Living Legacy, by purchasing this LIVING LEGACY TREE you confirm that you have read these instructions and agree to the following:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"LL does not warrant successful infusion where LL Guidelines are not followed, or where failure to grow is the result of environmental factors, force majeure or due to any mishandling or error made by Client."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You acknowledge that by purchasing LIVING LEGACY TREE that you do not do so in reliance on any representation, warranty or other provision except as expressly provided herein, and any conditions, warranties or other terms implied by statute or common law are, to the greatest extent permissible by law, excluded from this agreement to the fullest extent permitted by law."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You understand that except for the warranties provided in this clause, you accept full responsibility for your LIVING LEGACY TREE upon taking receipt of the TREE(S)."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You understand that you are responsible for choosing the appropriate tree, soil and location for the Living Legacy Tree. You are also responsible for providing security, care and maintenance of the tree and the site where the tree is located and with exception of the warranties provided herein you indemnify and hold Living Legacy harmless from and against any and all claims resulting from incidents occurring after delivery of the LIVING LEGACY TREE, or in relation to the maintenance and care of the tree."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Living Legacy’s sole and exclusive remedy for failed infusion or other breach of contract is to replace the tree(s) originally selected for infusion and re-supply the LIVING LEGACY TREE. You acknowledge that Living Legacy is not responsible for and will in no circumstances be responsible for retaining part of the ashes as a contingency if a new tree is to be planted under warranty."}]}]},"seoDescription":"Terms and conditions and the customer waiver for the Wellington Dam Memorial Forest conservation zone."}', 1794281081563);
